  "body": "## Complete Week 9 formal postgame audit\n\nIndependently captured ESPN and CFBD finals agree on all 54 eligible matchups. The original five preliminary On3 files remain unchanged. Decimal grading confirms ATS **28\u201326 (-0.545455 hypothetical units)** and totals **29\u201325 (+1.363636 units)** at -110. The latest saved human shortlist is 4\u20131; owner approval remains PENDING.\n\nThis additive implementation preserves all sealed picks, lines, forecasts, confidence, source bytes, manifests, hashes and Master Prompt v2.8. It adds all 108 grades, distinct frozen cohorts, Weeks 5\u20139 diagnostics, scoring-sequence evidence, game-process/observed-passer tables, documented FAU-to-SMU pregame review comparison and numerical proposals marked RESEARCH ONLY. CLV remains INCOMPLETE.\n\nDependency: PR #47 at `0d9a4b56bd49e3fbef4326aa7a5bd6eec9d13e29` is an ancestor. Base is main so the existing Pull Request Tests workflow verifies the actual proposed integration tree. No production workflow or security setting is changed.\n\nValidation so far: 35 new adversarial tests passed on native Windows Python 3.12.14; full native suite and exact-tree four-environment GitHub CI are in progress. See `docs/WEEK9_FORMAL_AUDIT_VERIFICATION.md` and `outputs/2026-week9-postgame-audit/v1/WEEK9_FORMAL_AUDIT.md`. Final source/tested merge SHAs and run URLs will be recorded after completion, not inferred.\n\nSchema changes: none. Database mutations: none. No unrelated files or original production repository changed. Rollback: abandon/revert only the additive implementation while retaining source captures and all earlier versions. Risks: missing qualified closes, small/confounded research cohorts, provider upstream dependence, and unvalidated probability scores. Do not promote a model or policy from this analysis.\n\n**HOLD. Draft remains open. Independent APPROVED review is required; no reviewer is designated. COMMENTED or author review is not approval. No merge, owner approval, policy promotion or production activation is authorized.**",
